{"version":1,"key":"card:456","content":{"id":456,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"执行字符串，这样做可能带来严重的安全隐患。"}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"exec"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"动态地执行字符串中的 Python 代码，并且可以在运行时生成、修改和执行代码"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> exec(\"print('Hello, world!')\")\nHello, world!","language":"py","uuid":"3b2cea46-ebe1-412f-a2e0-f2b0162d36cb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大多数情况下需要向它传递一个命名空间（用于放置变量的地方）；否则代码将污染你的命名空间"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> from math import sqrt\n>>> exec(\"sqrt = 1\")\n>>> sqrt(4)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<pyshell#18>\", line 1, in ?\n    sqrt(4)\nTypeError: object is not callable: 1","language":"py","uuid":"35eb492c-679e-4324-a087-cedf9d6217d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二个参数是一个字典，用作代码字符串的命名空间"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> from math import sqrt\n>>> scope = {}\n>>> exec('sqrt = 1', scope)\n>>> sqrt(4)\n2.0\n>>> scope['sqrt']\n1","language":"py","uuid":"a5ec9e35-2338-417e-ad8a-214408f6d1d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"eval"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"eval","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 计算用字符串表示的 Python 表达式的值，"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"并返回结果"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"（"},{"type":"formatted","text":"exec","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 什么都不返回，因为它本身是条语句）。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> eval(input(\"Enter an arithmetic expression: \"))\nEnter an arithmetic expression: 6 + 18 * 2\n42","language":"py","uuid":"f85f0408-6c8d-4f55-b4ce-544ab16d2b83","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可向 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"eval","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 提供一个命名空间。"}]},{"type":"divide-line","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"二者的主要区别："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"返回值：最主要的区别在于返回值。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"eval","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回计算结果，而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"exec","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不返回结果（或返回值为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"None","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用途："},{"type":"formatted","text":"eval","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用于计算表达式，而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"exec","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用于执行代码块或语句序列"}]}]}]}],"tags":["Python"],"createTime":1719190845930,"updateTime":1743303640441,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640441}}